    {
      "name": "恢复尺度与似然",
      "description": "在条件形状下恢复η，计算用于位置搜索的似然及位置得分。",
      "basis": "标准三参数Weibull似然；程序用logsumexp稳定幂和。",
      "notes": "",
      "formula": {
        "expression": "\\begin{gathered}\\eta=\\left(\\frac1n\\sum_i d_i^\\beta\\right)^{1/\\beta}\\\\[5pt]\\ell_p=n[\\ln\\beta-\\overline{\\ln d}-\\ln\\overline{e^{\\beta v}}-1]\\\\[5pt] s_\\gamma=n\\left[\\beta\\sum_i\\frac{w_i}{d_i}-(\\beta-1)\\overline{d^{-1}}\\right]\\end{gathered}",
        "explanation": "在条件形状下恢复η，计算用于位置搜索的似然及位置得分。",
        "symbols": [
          {
